OL,3,AIceland EU referendum on a knife edge
OL,4,Aas counting continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FIceland's closely fought referendum on
OL,7,Fwhether to resume membership talks with
OL,8,Fthe European Union is going down to
OL,9,Fwire, with the result too close to
OL,10,Fcall.
OL,12,FBased on the first 153,197 votes
OL,13,Fcounted of the 270,000 voters eligible,
OL,14,F50.1% rejected the government's
OL,15,Fproposal, while 49.9% said yes, public
OL,16,Fbroadcaster RUV said, with just 435
OL,17,Fvotes splitting them.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
